OL,3,GNEWSAI'm exhausted just being alive,
OL,4,Asays long Covid sufferer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose life has been "devastated"
OL,7,Fby "long Covid" has urged the prime
OL,8,Fminister to do more to help people
OL,9,Fliving with the condition.
OL,11,FDarren Parkinson said he contracted the
OL,12,Finitial virus in 2021 and now struggles
OL,13,Fto leave his home as a result of the
OL,14,Fafter-effects.
OL,16,FThe 50-year-old from Bradford said it
OL,17,Fhas cost him his job as a learning
OL,18,Fdisability nurse for the NHS and forced
OL,19,Fhim to stand down as a Green Party
OL,20,Fcouncillor on Shipley Town Council.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
